<title>RUSSIA: Russia Central Bank does not act on the T-bill mkt.</title>
<headline>Russia Central Bank does not act on the T-bill mkt.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank did not act on the government securities market on Tuesday on behalf of the Finance Ministry, the bank's open-market operations department said.</p>
<p>Apart from intervening on its own account for liquidity-smoothing and monetary policy purposes, the Central Bank buys and sells securities as part of its management of the Finance Ministry's debt and asset portfolio.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
